d 3-II and Band 3-III) participates in the ankyrin-1 complex (PubMed:35835865). Interacts (via the cytoplasmic domain) with EPB42; this interaction is mediated by the SLC4A1 Band 3-I dimer (PubMed:35835865). Interacts (via the cytoplasmic domain) directly with ANK1; this interaction is mediated by the SLC4A1 Band 3-II and Band 3-III dimers (PubMed:35835865, PubMed:7665627)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts (via N-terminus) with P.falciparum (isolate K1) aldolase FBPA; the interaction inhibits FBPA catalytic activity"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts (via the 5ABC region) with P.falciparum (isolate 3D7) MSP9/ABRA (via N-terminus)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts (via the 5ABC region) with P.falciparum (isolate 3D7) MSP1 p42 subunit"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P02730-2","name":"2","synonyms":["kAE1","Kidney"],"notes":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with TMEM139 (PubMed:26049106)"}],"length":846,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,66,846]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":65,"original":"MEELQDDYEDMMEENLEQEEYEDPDIPESQMEEPAAHDTE","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":65,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":11,"foldedMissing":11,"features":[[0,1,0],[1,65,0],[2,1,0],[3,19,0],[4,1,0],[5,1,0],[6,11,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-P02730-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P02730-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":83.6,"plddt":[[70,41],[90,9],[70,1],[90,9],[70,1],[90,16],[70,2],[90,2],[70,3],[90,1],[70,2],[90,2],[70,2],[90,2],[70,6],[50,8],[70,9],[50,1],[70,1],[50,1],[70,2],[50,7],[70,8],[50,2],[0,10],[50,9],[70,4],[90,8],[70,2],[90,1],[70,2],[90,8],[70,6],[50,6],[70,2],[90,10],[70,9],[90,9],[70,4],[90,1],[70,12],[90,2],[70,2],[90,2],[70,1],[90,2],[70,10],[50,2],[70,20],[50,2],[0,18],[50,2],[70,8],[90,2],[70,2],[90,2],[70,1],[90,3],[70,1],[90,10],[70,6],[90,13],[70,2],[90,1],[70,2],[90,2]